OL,3,AActor Imran Khan ordered to leave India
OL,4,Aafter participating in protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities in India have ordered actor
OL,7,FImran Khan, nephew of Bollywood star
OL,8,FAamir Khan, to leave the country by 28
OL,9,FOctober after he participated in a
OL,10,Fprotest, seeking electoral reforms.
OL,12,FAn American citizen, Khan holds an
OL,13,FOverseas Citizen of India (OCI) card,
OL,14,Fwhich allows people of Indian origin to
OL,15,Fvisit and stay in the country. But an
OL,16,FOCI cannot vote or contest elections.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
