OL,3,AActor Imran Khan ordered to leave India
OL,4,Aafter participating in protest
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Imran Khan participated in the
OL,7,Fagitation at Mumbai's August Kranti
OL,8,FMaidan, demanding the resignation of
OL,9,FChief Election Commissioner Gyanesh
OL,10,FKumar," police said in a statement on
OL,11,FThursday.
OL,13,FKhan's lawyer has said the actor will
OL,14,Fchallenge the order in the Bombay High
OL,15,FCourt.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
